# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BlinkGo Vercel Ignore
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Files that should NOT be uploaded to Vercel.
# This is independent of .gitignore — Vercel reads .vercelignore.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Build artifacts
.next
out
build
dist

# Dependencies (Vercel installs these fresh)
node_modules

# Test files (not needed for build)
coverage
.nyc_output
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx

# TypeScript build info
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local env files
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env*.local

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Vercel deployment metadata
.vercel

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Local Supabase
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# Test scripts (not needed for build, but safe to keep)
# scripts/

# Documentation (not needed for runtime)
# *.md

# CI/CD
.github
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.husky
.commitlintrc*

# Docker (not needed for Vercel)
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore

# Audit/Phase reports (not needed for runtime)
*_REPORT.md
*_SUMMARY.md
PHASE_*.md
AUDIT_*.md
V*_RELEASE_*
V*_AUDIT_*
OPERATOR-*
OPERATOR_*
PRODUCTION_*
REVIEW_*
DESIGN_*
SECURITY.md
LAUNCH_*
README.md
CODE_*
BUGFIX_*
BLINKGO_*
CLEANUP_*
DELIVERABLE*.md
deliverable-*.md
deliverable*.md

# Old test migration
wesseling_migration.sql
V*.md
